retrieval_date: 2026-06-14
format: DICOM VL Whole Slide Microscopy (5-instance pyramid, JPEG 2000 lossless)
scanner: 3DHISTECH Kft. Pannoramic 1000
license_spdx: CC0-1.0
license_file: 3DHISTECH-JP2K.LICENSE
instances: 5 (000010.dcm .. 000014.dcm); per-instance SHA-256 in manifest.json
citation: |
  Small-region (1792x1888 L0) 3DHISTECH Pannoramic 1000 whole-slide microscopy
  sample, a CC0 derivative of the 3DHISTECH DICOM datasets in the
  openslide-testdata DICOM corpus
  (https://openslide.cs.cmu.edu/download/openslide-testdata/DICOM/, listed CC0).
  JPEG 2000 (reversible/lossless) codec. Curated into the opentile-go / wsitools
  test pool as a compact JP2K-codec fixture; CC0 carries to derivatives.
